4,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I want us to find a way to fix the bins that makes everyone happy so we can all get along again. What information do we need to make this fair for everyone?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see everyone. I think it would be wonderful to know how other neighborhoods manage their bins, so we can ensure our own corner remains a pleasant place for all of us.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be practical. I want to know the actual labor involved in maintenance and the specific requirements from the ward office so we don't create an unsustainable burden for a few people.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I agree with Asuka! We have to make sure it's actually fair. If one person has to do all the hard work or let the bins stay at their gate, that's not a fair deal!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure a truly harmonious result, we must consider the financial burden. Let us look into the costs to ensure the arrangement is sustainable for every household's budget.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That makes sense! If we know what others do and what the rules are, we can pick something that doesn't make anyone grumpy. Maybe we should check out how the next lane does it?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful idea, Kenji. Seeing how our neighbors handle things might give us some gentle inspiration. I would also love to know what the residents' meeting had to say about these matters.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, meeting minutes are fine, but we need hard data. I suggest we look at the ward complaint log to see exactly what's failing and the truck arrival times to understand the daily operational flow.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that's smart! But we also need to know how big everyone's front area is. If we just pick a spot without measuring, someone might get a tiny space while others have lots of room!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, space and time are precious. However, we must not forget the ledger. Let us examine the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy to see what funds we truly have.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I think we're getting a good list! I want to make sure we don't just follow rules, but actually feel good about the result. Maybe we should also see how the station block's bin house works?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a lovely suggestion, Kenji. Visiting the station block's bin house would let us see a real example of how things can be kept tidy and peaceful for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, a visit is fine for aesthetics, but it doesn't tell us about the workload. I'll focus on the ward filing requirements and the complaint log to identify the root causes of the current friction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you're always so serious! But I'm still worried about the space. I want to see the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log too, so we know who's been suffering!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from understanding both the heart and the purse. I shall look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs to ensure fairness for all.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house! I want to see what actually works in real life so we can all be friends again.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the statements at the residents' meeting. I hope to learn how we can keep our hearts and our street happy.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the ward complaint log for this point. We need to understand the administrative burden and the specific failures of the current system.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log! I want to make sure we don't just push the bins onto someone who doesn't have any room!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall examine the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs. Let us seek a path that is gentle on everyone's wallet and sustainable for the future.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
